# License — Whole Earth Curriculum

## Curriculum & scholastic content

All curriculum content, standards, lessons, documentation, and scholastic assets in
this repository are licensed under the **Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International (CC BY-SA 4.0)** license.

This means you are free to:

- **Share** — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format for any
  purpose, even commercially.
- **Adapt** — remix, transform, and build upon the material for any purpose, even
  commercially.

Under the following terms:

- **Attribution** — you must give appropriate credit, provide a link to the license,
  and indicate if changes were made.
- **ShareAlike** — if you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you must
  distribute your contributions under the same license as the original.

This ShareAlike term is deliberate: it keeps the curriculum, and anything built on
it, open and free for everyone — preventing it from being captured and closed off by
the few.

The canonical, legally-binding text of the license is available at:

<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode>

A human-readable summary is at:

<https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/>

